<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Nov c/a deficit down at 9.3 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria Nov c/a deficit down at 9.3 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of schillings)</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT     NOVEMBER   OCTOBER   NOV. 95</p>
<p> Current account balance	 -9.3	 -12.4     -8.4</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance     -8.0	 -10.5     -8.5</p>
<p> Exports			     67.3	  68.5     61.7</p>
<p> Imports			     74.4	  76.4     68,3</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JANUARY TO MONTH IN QUESTION)</p>
<p> Current account balance	-57.7	 -48.4    -48.9</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance    -44.5	 -36.6    -34.8</p>
<p> Exports			    694.3	 627.0    660.4</p>
<p> Imports			    766.6	 692.2    731.1</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
